{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249460/extras/wishlist_and_follow.gif?t=1743721122\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Not your typical monster collector! <br>A Unique (async) <strong><u>PVP</u>/<u>PVE</u></strong> \u00a0Experience! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hey! Do you love relics? Yeah I thought so... We LOVE relics. <strong>NikNaks</strong> are relics that can fight!   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>NikNaks</strong> are effective both ON and OFF the field!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249460/extras/break_game.gif?t=1743721122\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249460/extras/combo-2.gif?t=1743721122\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create <strong>INSANE</strong> COMBOS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022Select your <strong><u>GOD</u></strong> at the start of each run </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022Reorder your hand to cheat out crazy effects </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022Draft Niknaks that synergize well with one another to build the best team. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022Stack niknaks together to create powerhouse builds  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249460/extras/may_ways_to_play.gif?t=1743721122\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249460/extras/ascend.gif?t=1743721122\" /> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022After <strong>each battle</strong> get a chance to draft new <strong>teammates</strong>,  and other <strong>upgrades</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022Multiple zones, each with its own theme, rewards,  and enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No AI was used in creating this game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3249460?t=1743721122","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3249460?t=1743721122","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249460/b9f90357d5fe4e341870444e61db5985f2e63249/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743721122","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249460/b9f90357d5fe4e341870444e61db5985f2e63249/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743721122","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249460/extras/wishlist_and_follow.gif?t=1743721122\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Not your typical monster collector! <br>A Unique (async) <strong><u>PVP</u>/<u>PVE</u></strong> \u00a0Experience! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hey! Do you love relics? Yeah I thought so... We LOVE relics. <strong>NikNaks</strong> are relics that can fight!   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>NikNaks</strong> are effective both ON and OFF the field!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p cla